{#
 # The cell that names its row, for a table whose rows are not interchangeable records but named
 # things — an exercise, a category. It is what tells a screen reader which row a figure belongs to
 # when the column header alone ("90%") says nothing.
 #
 # It takes no `label`: below md it becomes the title of the card the row turns into.
 #}
<th scope="row"{{ attributes }}>
    {% block content %}{% endblock %}
</th>
